    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUICE is a horror FPS told through two stories about the end of the world. Play as a hungry beast and a lone survivor. Wreak havoc with swift, brutal combat, growing from a drooling larva to a colossal terror. At the same time, barricade your home and say goodbye to loved ones, trying to stay calm before it all collapses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Features:</u></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Gory Action</strong> <br>Mix quick shooter moves with fierce melee for stomach-turning mayhem.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand Drawn World</strong><br>Spatter blood across a dark illustrated Noir city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Intense</strong><br>Finish in a few sittings for a strong crunchy experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Linked Storylines, Two Endings</strong><br>Save or ruin the world, it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong><br>Hunt tasty humans in multiple arenas and stack up points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metal Noisecore Soundtrack</strong><br>Hear your ears bleed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.poster.avif?t=1754078004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.webm?t=1754078004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.mp4?t=1754078004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUICE is a horror FPS told through two stories about the end of the world. Play as a hungry beast and a lone survivor. Wreak havoc with swift, brutal combat, growing from a drooling larva to a colossal terror. At the same time, barricade your home and say goodbye to loved ones, trying to stay calm before it all collapses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Features:</u></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Gory Action</strong> <br>Mix quick shooter moves with fierce melee for stomach-turning mayhem.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand Drawn World</strong><br>Spatter blood across a dark illustrated Noir city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Intense</strong><br>Finish in a few sittings for a strong crunchy experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Linked Storylines, Two Endings</strong><br>Save or ruin the world, it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong><br>Hunt tasty humans in multiple arenas and stack up points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metal Noisecore Soundtrack</strong><br>Hear your ears bleed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.poster.avif?t=1754078004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.webm?t=1754078004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/7ca48bda1ece676f330fb1ef796eed31.mp4?t=1754078004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Survive in this brutal horror FPS! JUICE follows a wild monster on a rampage and one person's final stand. Will you destroy the world or see another sunrise?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
